{"id":"298ee1b282da57bf","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-finite-developments.md","title":"有限发展定理","display":"thm-finite-developments — 有限发展定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"theorem","label":"56-thm-finite-developments","aliases":["56-thm-finite-developments"],"display":"thm-finite-developments — 有限发展定理","depends_on":["[[56-df-development]]","[[56-lem-development-measure-decrease]]","[[56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded]]"],"source_section":"§4.5 Theorem 4.5.4; §4.4 Proposition 4.4.5","source_printed_pages":"103,107","source_ocr_blocks":[124,128],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-finite-developments"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-finite-developments</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-developments — 有限发展定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" href=\"?note=ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" title=\"56-df-development\">56-df-development</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d733f353e873b30\" href=\"?note=6d733f353e873b30\" title=\"56-lem-development-measure-decrease\">56-lem-development-measure-decrease</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fa249af3230be7c7\" href=\"?note=fa249af3230be7c7\" title=\"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded\">56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.5 Theorem 4.5.4; §4.4 Proposition 4.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"103,107"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>128</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{InfDev}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{InfDev}_R\\)</span>、无限序列类型见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" href=\"?note=ba77cd70a7f1fd67\" title=\"56-df-development\">56-df-development</a>；发展步测度下降见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d733f353e873b30\" href=\"?note=6d733f353e873b30\" title=\"56-lem-development-measure-decrease\">56-lem-development-measure-decrease</a>。</li>\n<li>自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&gt;\">\\(&gt;\\)</span> 的有限多重集良基性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fa249af3230be7c7\" href=\"?note=fa249af3230be7c7\" title=\"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded\">56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded</a>；工作于ZFC。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(t_0=s\\land\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(t_0=s\\land\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反设存在该无限发展。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_i=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)\">\\(U_i=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)\\)</span>。单步递归给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{i+1}=\\operatorname{ResStep}_R((t_i,v_i,t_{i+1}),U_i)\">\\(U_{i+1}=\\operatorname{ResStep}_R((t_i,v_i,t_{i+1}),U_i)\\)</span>，发展条件给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_i\\in U_i\">\\(v_i\\in U_i\\)</span>。于是测度下降引理产生\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_0,U_0)&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_1,U_1)&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\cdots\">\\(\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_0,U_0)&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_1,U_1)&gt;^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\cdots\\)</span>，\n与自然数序的有限多重集良基性矛盾。</p>\n<p>此证明把原书 4.4.5 的带线测度及 4.5.4 的“由带线 SN 立即得到 FD”逐位置展开。本结论排除无限发展；允许复制规则令发展步数超过初始 redex 数，也允许整个TRS存在无限的非发展归约。没有把有限归约编码自身的有限性当作 FD 的证明。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Theorem 4.5.4、Proposition 4.4.5；已读原书证明并内建到本地测度下降链，未作机器证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-development","status":"resolved","id":"ba77cd70a7f1fd67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-development-measure-decrease","status":"resolved","id":"6d733f353e873b30","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-development-measure-decrease]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"fa249af3230be7c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-development","status":"resolved","id":"ba77cd70a7f1fd67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{InfDev}_R$、无限序列类型见 [[56-df-development]]；发展步测度下降见 [[56-lem-development-measure-decrease]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-development-measure-decrease","status":"resolved","id":"6d733f353e873b30","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{InfDev}_R$、无限序列类型见 [[56-df-development]]；发展步测度下降见 [[56-lem-development-measure-decrease]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"fa249af3230be7c7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"自然数 $>$ 的有限多重集良基性见 [[56-thm-multiset-extension-well-founded]]；工作于ZFC。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{InfDev}_R","display":false},{"tex":">","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\exists\\boldsymbol t\\in T^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\exists\\boldsymbol v\\in\\mathcal E_R^{\\mathbb N}\\;\n\\left(t_0=s\\land\\operatorname{InfDev}_R(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v,U)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"U_i=\\operatorname{Res}_R(\\operatorname{pref}_i(\\boldsymbol t,\\boldsymbol v),U)","display":false},{"tex":"U_{i+1}=\\operatorname{ResStep}_R((t_i,v_i,t_{i+1}),U_i)","display":false},{"tex":"v_i\\in U_i","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_0,U_0)>^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(t_1,U_1)>^{\\mathrm{mul}}\\cdots","display":false}],"bytes":2058,"backlinks":[{"id":"8739f2bb78813039","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交系统，$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。$\\operatorname{wit}_R,\\bullet,\\approx_R,\\preccurlyeq_R$ 见 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]、[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]。指定残余的平行移动及完整发展菱形见 [[56-lem-residual-parallel-moves]]、[[56-thm-complete-development-diamond]]，发展有限性见 [[56-thm-finite-developments]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-finite-developments.md]]"},{"id":"06c0295d39a97a66","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"FD、临界对引理、Newman引理见 [[56-thm-finite-developments]]、[[56-thm-critical-pair-lemma]]、[[56-thm-newman-lemma]]；工作于ZFC。"}],"outgoing":["ba77cd70a7f1fd67","6d733f353e873b30","fa249af3230be7c7"]}